ely on to handle vault shares safely.\n\n\n\n\n### Recommendation\n\nMake the share token's reported decimals consistent with the ERC-4626 math by removing the custom `decimals()` override and inherit the OpenZeppelin default (`asset decimals + _decimalsOffset()`, which is `12`.)\n\nThe share accounting unit and the published ERC-20 decimals must match.",
